msgid "Options"
msgstr "Òptacëje"

#: kcmlayout.cpp:541
msgid "None"
msgstr "Felënk"

#: kxkbapp.cpp:109
msgid "A utility to switch keyboard maps"
msgstr "Nôrzãdzë do przełãczaniô mapów klawiaturów"

#: kxkbapp.cpp:113
msgid "KDE Keyboard Layout Switcher"
msgstr "Przełącznik ùkłôdów klawiaturów KDE"

#: kxkbbindings.cpp:15
msgid "Keyboard"
msgstr "Klawiatura"

#: kxkbbindings.cpp:16
msgid "Switch to Next Keyboard Layout"
msgstr "Przełączë do pòstãpnégò ùkłôdu klawiaturë"

#: kxkbwidget.cpp:47
#, qt-format
msgid "Error changing keyboard layout to '%1'"
msgstr "Fela przełączaniô do ùkłôdu klawiaturë '%1'"

#: kxkbwidget.cpp:97
msgid "Configure..."
msgstr "Kònfigùracëjô..."

#: kxkbwidget.cpp:102
msgid "Help"
msgstr "Pòmòc"

#. i18n: tag string
#. i18n: file kcmlayoutwidget.ui line 43
#. i18n: tag string
#. i18n: file kcmlayoutwidget.ui line 135
#. i18n: tag string
#. i18n: file kcmlayoutwidget.ui line 240
#: rc.cpp:3 rc.cpp:31 rc.cpp:55
msgid "Layout"
msgstr "Ùkłôd"

#. i18n: tag string
#. i18n: file kcmlayoutwidget.ui line 55
#: rc.cpp:6
msgid "&Enable keyboard layouts"
msgstr "&Włączë ùkłôdë klawiaturë"

#. i18n: tag string
#. i18n: file kcmlayoutwidget.ui line 65
#: rc.cpp:9
msgid ""
"<h1>Keyboard Layout</h1> Here you can choose your keyboard layout and model. "
"The 'model' refers to the type of keyboard that is connected to your "
"computer, while the keyboard layout defines \"which key does what\" and may "
"be different for different countries."
msgstr ""
"<h1>Ùkłôd klawiaturë</h1> Tuwò mòżesz wëbrac swój ùkłôd ë mòdel klawiaturë. "
"'Mòdel' tikô sã ôrtowi klawiaturë jaką môsz przëłączoné do swòjégò kòmpùtra "
"a ùkłôd definiuje \"co robi jaczi klawisza\" ë mòże bëc jiny w różnych "
"krôjach."

#. i18n: tag string
#. i18n: file kcmlayoutwidget.ui line 83
#: rc.cpp:12
msgid "Available layouts:"
msgstr "Przistãpny ùkłôdë:"

#. i18n: tag string
#. i18n: file kcmlayoutwidget.ui line 90
#: rc.cpp:15
msgid "Active layouts:"
msgstr "Aktiwny ùkłôdë:"

#. i18n: tag string
#. i18n: file kcmlayoutwidget.ui line 97
#: rc.cpp:18
msgid "Keyboard &model:"
msgstr "&Model klawiaturë:"

#. i18n: tag string
#. i18n: file kcmlayoutwidget.ui line 116
#: rc.cpp:21
msgid ""
"Here you can choose a keyboard model. This setting is independent of your "
"keyboard layout and refers to the \"hardware\" model, i.e. the way your "
"keyboard is manufactured. Modern keyboards that come with your computer "
"usually have two extra keys and are referred to as \"104-key\" models, which "
"is probably what you want if you do not know what kind of keyboard you "
"have.\n"
msgstr ""
"Tuwò mòżesz wëbrac mòdel klawiaturë. Nen ùstôw nie zanôlegô òd Twòjégò "
"ùkłôdu klawiaturë ë tikô sã mòdelowi \"hard-wôrë\", np. ôrtu na jaczi Twòjô "
"klawiatura je zrobionô. Nowôczasny klawiaturë zwëkòwò mają dwa dodôwny "
"klawisze ë zwóny sã mòdelama \"104-klawiszowima\", co gwës mdze tim co "
"chcesz, czej nie wiész jaczi ôrt klawiaturë môsz.\n"

#. i18n: tag string
#. i18n: file kcmlayoutwidget.ui line 123
#: rc.cpp:25
msgid ""
"If more than one layout is present in this list, the KDE panel will offer a "
"docked flag. By clicking on this flag you can easily switch between layouts. "
"The first layout will be default one."
msgstr ""
"Jeżlë wicy jakno jeden ùkłôd klawiaturë je na ti lësce, panel KDE wëskrzëni "
"dokòwóną fanã. Klëkając na ni mòżesz prosto przełączëc sã midze ùkłôdama. "
"Pierszi ùkłôd mdze domëslny."

#. i18n: tag string
#. i18n: file kcmlayoutwidget.ui line 130
#: rc.cpp:28
msgid "1"
msgstr "1"

#. i18n: tag string
#. i18n: file kcmlayoutwidget.ui line 140
#. i18n: tag string
#. i18n: file kcmlayoutwidget.ui line 245
#: rc.cpp:34 rc.cpp:58
msgid "Keymap"
msgstr "Mapa klawiszów"

#. i18n: tag string
#. i18n: file kcmlayoutwidget.ui line 145
#: rc.cpp:37
msgid "Variant"
msgstr "Wariant"

#. i18n: tag string
#. i18n: file kcmlayoutwidget.ui line 150
#: rc.cpp:40
msgid "Label"
msgstr "Marka"

#. i18n: tag string
#. i18n: file kcmlayoutwidget.ui line 166
#: rc.cpp:43
msgid "Add >>"
msgstr "Dodôj >>"

#. i18n: tag string
#. i18n: file kcmlayoutwidget.ui line 173
#: rc.cpp:46
msgid "<< Remove"
msgstr "<< Rëmôj"

#. i18n: tag string
#. i18n: file kcmlayoutwidget.ui line 212
#. i18n: tag string
#. i18n: file kcmlayoutwidget.ui line 553
#: rc.cpp:49 rc.cpp:128
msgid "Command:"
msgstr "Pòlét:"

#. i18n: tag string
#. i18n: file kcmlayoutwidget.ui line 228
#: rc.cpp:52
msgid ""
"This is the list of available keyboard layouts in your system. You can add a "
"layout to the active list by selecting it and pressing \"Add\" button."
msgstr ""
"To je lësta przistãpnych ùkłôdów klawiaturë dlô Twòji systemë. Mòżesz dodac "
"ùkłôd do aktiwny lëstë wëbierając gò ë wcëskając knąpã \"Dodôj\"."

#. i18n: tag string
#. i18n: file kcmlayoutwidget.ui line 253
#: rc.cpp:61
msgid ""
"This is the command which is executed when switching to the selected layout. "
"It may help you if you want to debug layout switching, or if you want to "
"switch layouts without the help of KDE."
msgstr ""
"To je pòlét jaczi bãdze zrëszony òbczas przełączaniô do wëbrónégò ùkłôdu. "
"Mòże pòmóc, czej chcesz debugòwac przełączanié ùkłôdów, abò czej chcesz "
"przełączac ùkłôdë bez pòmòcë KDE."

#. i18n: tag string
#. i18n: file kcmlayoutwidget.ui line 263
#: rc.cpp:64
msgid "Label:"
msgstr "Marka:"

#. i18n: tag string
#. i18n: file kcmlayoutwidget.ui line 283
#: rc.cpp:67
msgid "Layout variant:"
msgstr "Wariant ùkłôdu:"

#. i18n: tag string
#. i18n: file kcmlayoutwidget.ui line 294
#: rc.cpp:70
msgid ""
"Here you can choose a variant of selected keyboard layout. Layout variants "
"usually represent different key maps for the same language. For example, "
"Ukrainian layout might have four variants: basic, winkeys (as in Windows), "
"typewriter (as in typewriters) and phonetic (each Ukrainian letter is placed "
"on a transliterated latin one).\n"
msgstr ""
"Tuwò mòżesz wëbrac wariant wëbrónégò ùkłôdu klawiaturë. Wariantë te zwëkòwò "
"reprezentëją różné mapòwanie klawiszów dlô tegò samégò jãzëka. Na przëmiôr, "
"ùkrajińsczi ùkłôd mòże miec wariantë: basic (pòdspòdlowi), winkeys (tak jak "
"w Windowsë), maszynistczi (jak w maszynach do pisaniô) ë fònetikòwi (kòżdô "
"ùkrajińskô lëtera je pòłożona na môlu gwësny lacëzniany lëtery).\n"

#. i18n: tag string
#. i18n: file kcmlayoutwidget.ui line 337
#: rc.cpp:74
msgid "Switching Options"
msgstr "Òptacëje przełączaniô"

#. i18n: tag string
#. i18n: file kcmlayoutwidget.ui line 383
#: rc.cpp:77
msgid ""
"If you select \"Application\" or \"Window\" switching policy, changing the "
"keyboard layout will only affect the current application or window."
msgstr ""
"Żelë wëbierzesz pòlitikã przełączaniô \"Programa\" abò \"Òkno\", zmiana "
"ùkłôdu klawiaturë bãdze sã tikac blós aplikacëji abò òkna."

#. i18n: tag string
#. i18n: file kcmlayoutwidget.ui line 386
#: rc.cpp:80
msgid "Switching Policy"
msgstr "Pòlitika przełączaniô"

#. i18n: tag string
#. i18n: file kcmlayoutwidget.ui line 404
#: rc.cpp:83
msgid "&Global"
msgstr "&Globalnô"

#. i18n: tag string
#. i18n: file kcmlayoutwidget.ui line 414
#: rc.cpp:86
msgid "Application"
msgstr "Programa"

#. i18n: tag string
#. i18n: file kcmlayoutwidget.ui line 421
#: rc.cpp:89
msgid "&Window"
msgstr "Ò&kno"

#. i18n: tag string
#. i18n: file kcmlayoutwidget.ui line 431
#: rc.cpp:92
msgid "Shows country flag on background of layout name in tray icon"
msgstr "Pòkażë fanã kraju na spòdlém miona ùkłôdu w zabérnikù"

#. i18n: tag string
#. i18n: file kcmlayoutwidget.ui line 434
#: rc.cpp:95
msgid "Show country flag"
msgstr "Pòkażë fanã kraju"

#. i18n: tag string
#. i18n: file kcmlayoutwidget.ui line 444
#: rc.cpp:98
msgid "Sticky Switching"
msgstr "Przelepioné przełączanié"

#. i18n: tag string
#. i18n: file kcmlayoutwidget.ui line 456
#: rc.cpp:101
msgid ""
"If you have more than two layouts and turn this option on, switching with "
"the keyboard shortcut or clicking on the kxkb indicator will only cycle "
"through the last few layouts. You can specify the number of layouts to "
"rotate below. You can still access all layouts by right-clicking on the kxkb "
"indicator."
msgstr ""
"Żelë môsz wicy jakno dwa ùkłôdë ë włączësz nã òptacëjã, przełaczanié "
"klawiszową skrodzëną abò klëkanié na pòkôzywôcz kxkb bãdze le cykelowac sã "
"na slédno brëkòwónych ùkłôdach. Niżi nòżesz òtaksowac lëczbã ùkłôdów do "
"cykelu.Wiedno mòżesz wëbierac jine ùkłôdë klëkając prawą knąpą mëszë na "
"pòkôzywôcz kxkb."

#. i18n: tag string
#. i18n: file kcmlayoutwidget.ui line 459
#: rc.cpp:104
msgid "Enable sticky switching"
msgstr "Włączë przelepioné przełączanié"

#. i18n: tag string
#. i18n: file kcmlayoutwidget.ui line 469
#: rc.cpp:107
msgid "Number of layouts to rotate:"
msgstr "Lëczba ùkłôdów do òbrotu:"

#. i18n: tag string
#. i18n: file kcmlayoutwidget.ui line 495
#: rc.cpp:110
msgid "Show indicator for single layout"
msgstr "Pòkôżë indikatorã dlô pòjedińczégò ùkłôdu"

#. i18n: tag string
#. i18n: file kcmlayoutwidget.ui line 506
#. i18n: tag string
#. i18n: file kcmlayoutwidget.ui line 531
#: rc.cpp:113 rc.cpp:122
msgid "Xkb Options"
msgstr "Òptacëje xkb"

#. i18n: tag string
#. i18n: file kcmlayoutwidget.ui line 518
#: rc.cpp:116
msgid "&Enable xkb options"
msgstr "&Włączë òptacëje xkb"

#. i18n: tag string
#. i18n: file kcmlayoutwidget.ui line 528
#: rc.cpp:119
msgid ""
"Here you can set xkb extension options instead of, or in addition to, "
"specifying them in the X11 configuration file."
msgstr ""
"Tuwò mòżesz ùstawic òptacëje rozszérzenia xkb w môl abò dodównié do òpisania "
"jich w kònfigùracëjowim lopkù X11."

#. i18n: tag string
#. i18n: file kcmlayoutwidget.ui line 546
#: rc.cpp:125
msgid "&Reset old options"
msgstr "&Dostóné nazôd stôri òptacëje"

#. i18n: tag string
#. i18n: file kcmmiscwidget.ui line 25
#: rc.cpp:134
msgid ""
"If supported, this option allows you to setup the state of NumLock after KDE "
"startup.<p>You can configure NumLock to be turned on or off, or configure "
"KDE not to set NumLock state."
msgstr ""
"Żelë wspieróné, ta òptacëja pòzwôlô na ùstôwienié stónu NumLocka pò sztarce "
"KDE.<p>Mòżesz kònfigùrowac NumLock, żebë bëł włączony abò wëłączony abò "
"kònfigùrowac KDE tak, bë nie ùstôwiôł stónu NumLocka."

#. i18n: tag string
#. i18n: file kcmmiscwidget.ui line 28
#: rc.cpp:137
msgid "NumLock on KDE Startup"
msgstr "NumLock przë starcë KDE"

#. i18n: tag string
#. i18n: file kcmmiscwidget.ui line 43
#: rc.cpp:140
msgid "Turn o&ff"
msgstr "&Wëłączë"

#. i18n: tag string
#. i18n: file kcmmiscwidget.ui line 50
#: rc.cpp:143
msgid "Leave unchan&ged"
msgstr "Òstawi &bez zmianów"

#. i18n: tag string
#. i18n: file kcmmiscwidget.ui line 57
#: rc.cpp:146
msgid "T&urn on"
msgstr "Włą&czë"

#. i18n: tag string
#. i18n: file kcmmiscwidget.ui line 67
#: rc.cpp:149
msgid "Keyboard Repeat"
msgstr "Pòwtórzenié klawiaturë"

#. i18n: tag string
#. i18n: file kcmmiscwidget.ui line 87
#: rc.cpp:152
msgid "&Delay:"
msgstr "Ò&pózdnienié"

#. i18n: tag string
#. i18n: file kcmmiscwidget.ui line 97
#. i18n: tag string
#. i18n: file kcmmiscwidget.ui line 125
#: rc.cpp:155 rc.cpp:158
msgid ""
"If supported, this option allows you to set the delay after which a pressed "
"key will start generating keycodes. The 'Repeat rate' option controls the "
"frequency of these keycodes."
msgstr ""
"Żelë wspiéróné, ta òptacëjô pòzwôle na ùstawienié òpózdnieniô pò jaczim "
"wcësniãti klawisza bãdze dôwôł swój kòd. Òptacëjô 'kòeficjent pòwtórzeniô' "
"kòntrolëje czãstotliwòsc generowaniô kòdu."

#. i18n: tag string
#. i18n: file kcmmiscwidget.ui line 140
#: rc.cpp:161
msgid "&Rate:"
msgstr "&Kòeficjent:"

#. i18n: tag string
#. i18n: file kcmmiscwidget.ui line 150
#. i18n: tag string
#. i18n: file kcmmiscwidget.ui line 178
#: rc.cpp:164 rc.cpp:167
msgid ""
"If supported, this option allows you to set the rate at which keycodes are "
"generated while a key is pressed."
msgstr ""
"Jeżlë je wspiéróné, ta òptacëjô pòzwôlô na ùstawienié chùtkòscë generowaniô "
"céchów pò wcësniãcu klawisza."

#. i18n: tag string
#. i18n: file kcmmiscwidget.ui line 185
#: rc.cpp:170
msgid ""
"If you check this option, pressing and holding down a key emits the same "
"character over and over again. For example, pressing and holding down the "
"Tab key will have the same effect as that of pressing that key several times "
"in succession: Tab characters continue to be emitted until you release the "
"key."
msgstr ""
"Eżlë ta òptacëjô je włączona, wciśnięcie ë przëtrzymanie klawisza robi "
"wielorazowé sélanié tegò samegò céchù. Na przëmiôr przëcësniãcé ë "
"przëtrzëmanié klawiszë Tab bãdze mia taczi sóm efekt, jak czilerazowé "
"wcësniãcé gò. Céchë tabùlacëji są sélóné dopóczi nie pùscësz klawiszë."

#. i18n: tag string
#. i18n: file kcmmiscwidget.ui line 188
#: rc.cpp:173
msgid "&Enable keyboard repeat"
msgstr "&Włączë pòwtarzanié klawiaturë"

#. i18n: tag string
#. i18n: file kcmmiscwidget.ui line 201
#. i18n: tag string
#. i18n: file kcmmiscwidget.ui line 216
#: rc.cpp:176 rc.cpp:179
#, c-format
msgid ""
"If supported, this option allows you to hear audible clicks from your "
"computer's speakers when you press the keys on your keyboard. This might be "
"useful if your keyboard does not have mechanical keys, or if the sound that "
"the keys make is very soft.<p>You can change the loudness of the key click "
"feedback by dragging the slider button or by clicking the up/down arrows on "
"the spin box. Setting the volume to 0% turns off the key click."
msgstr ""
"Eżlë ta òptacëjô je òbsłëdżiwónô, pò ji włączenim czëc z kòmpùtrowégò "
"głosnika (brzãczka) klëkniãcô, czedë przëcësnié sã na klawiszã na "
"klawiaturze. Mòże bëc ùżëtny, jeżlë nié mô się mechaniczny klawiaturë abò "
"zwãk klawiszów je baro mitczi.<p>Mòże dopasowac głosnosc tich zwãków, "
"przecygając pòsuwk abò brëkùjąc knąpów góra/dół. Ùstôw głosnoscë na 0% "
"wëłączô generowónié zwãków przez brzãczk."

#. i18n: tag string
#. i18n: file kcmmiscwidget.ui line 219
#: rc.cpp:182
msgid "Key click &volume:"
msgstr "Klawisza &głosnoscë:"

